+- Affected tests: hybrid retrieval, matcher, and new diversification unit tests using local fakes/mocks.
+- No catalog data, index representation, embedding model, Qdrant collection, reranker prompt, GOLD/harness artifacts, or index rebuild is required.
diff --git a/openspec/changes/cycle-16-structural-candidate-diversification/specs/structural-candidate-diversification/spec.md b/openspec/changes/cycle-16-structural-candidate-diversification/specs/structural-candidate-diversification/spec.md
